    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Some shaman find serenity in the restorative properties of water. They do not seek the Light or turn to the divine, yet they feel a profound spiritual connection to the source of mortal life. So strong is their connection to water that the shaman may draw on its power to restore life and heal afflictions, like a tidal wave across a sandy shore. They balance their charge with the other elements, striving for balance and harmony.</p><p>When you pick this binding at 3rd level, you can use the Riptide totem power.</p>",
